#: ../../language/error_codes/E0087.md:1
msgid "E0087"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0087.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `guard_inexhaustive`"
msgstr "警告名：`guard_inexhaustive`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0087.md:5
msgid ""
"A `guard` without an `else` clause may fail. When its condition is false "
"or its pattern does not match, it would implicitly terminate the program."
msgstr ""
"`else` 節のない `guard` は失敗する可能性があります。条件が偽になるかパターンが一致しない場合、プログラムは暗黙的に終了します。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0087.md:8
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "誤った例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0087.md:10
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn unwrap(value : Int?) -> Int {\n"
"  guard value is Some(result)\n"
"  result\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0087.md:14
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修正方法"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0087.md:16
msgid ""
"Add an `else` clause to handle failure, or use `guard!` when termination "
"is intentional."
msgstr "失敗を処理する `else` 節を追加するか、意図的に終了させる場合は `guard!` を使います。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0087.md:19
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn unwrap_or_zero(value : Int?) -> Int {\n"
"  guard value is Some(result) else { 0 }\n"
"  result\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub fn require_some(value : Int?) -> Int {\n"
"  guard! value is Some(result)\n"
"  result\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
